<title>COLOMBIA: SOCCER-COLOMBIA BEAT ECUADOR 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLOMBIA BEAT ECUADOR 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BARRANQUILLA, Colombia 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia beat Ecuador 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier Sunday</p>
<p>Scorer: Antony de Avila (86)</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
